## **6.5 Motion Code Standard**

Contoh implementasi GSAP dalam React:

```
import { useLayoutEffect, useRef } from "react";
import gsap from "gsap";
import { ScrollTrigger } from "gsap/ScrollTrigger";

gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

export default function VisionSection() {
  const sectionRef = useRef(null);

  useLayoutEffect(() => {
    const ctx = gsap.context(() => {
      gsap.from(".vision-title", {
        y: 80,
        opacity: 0,
        duration: 1,
        ease: "power3.out",
        scrollTrigger: {
          trigger: sectionRef.current,
          start: "top 75%",
          once: true,
        },
      });
    }, sectionRef);

    return () => ctx.revert();
  }, []);

  return (
    <section ref={sectionRef}>
      <h2 className="vision-title">
        BEYOND THE LIMIT.
      </h2>
    </section>
  );
}
```

Standar implementasi:

- Gunakan `gsap.context()` untuk scope animasi.
- Bersihkan animasi ketika komponen unmount.
- Hindari membuat ScrollTrigger berulang tanpa cleanup.
- Gunakan `transform` dan `opacity` jika memungkinkan.
- Hormati `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Jangan memaksa smooth scroll pada pengguna yang memilih reduced motion.

